{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_9A273E1F","title":"The ballad of Hepzibah Gimble 2","entry":"Dlg_9A273E1F::entry","exit":"Dlg_9A273E1F::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_8003607B","articyId":"72057821671263889","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"I knew you would be back.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I knew you would be back.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":500.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27293","byteOffset":18206680,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_848DDF55","articyId":"72057821671263896","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Are you gonna kill me now too Hepzibah?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you gonna kill me now too Hepzibah?","TextSheVersion":"Are you gonna kill me now too Hepzibah?","TextTheyVersion":"Are you gonna kill me now too Hepzibah?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":800.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27963","byteOffset":18459440,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_C71210D3","articyId":"72057821671263903","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You set me on this track deliberately.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You set me on this track deliberately.","TextSheVersion":"You set me on this track deliberately.","TextTheyVersion":"You set me on this track deliberately."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1400.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47204","byteOffset":32193144,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_CD9B30B0","articyId":"72057821671263910","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Thaddeus is not behind everything. He didn't help, but he didn't stop me either. He just wanted something for himself.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thaddeus is not behind everything. He didn't help, but he didn't stop me either. He just wanted something for himself.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3200.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40790","byteOffset":29758248,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_06BDA20D","articyId":"72057821671263917","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Whatever you're getting upset about, I'm sure it's not worth the time or energy. Why don't you get to the point dear?","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whatever you're getting upset about, I'm sure it's not worth the time or energy. Why don't you get to the point dear?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1100.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40965","byteOffset":29825520,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_51C10A5D","articyId":"72057821671263924","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Ava. Your ticket to get on the white list.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ava. Your ticket to get on the white list.","TextSheVersion":"Ava. Your ticket to get on the white list.","TextTheyVersion":"Ava. Your ticket to get on the white list."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3500.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19186","byteOffset":15143136,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_FB503D13","articyId":"72057821671263932","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"She kept me safe for 122 long years.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She kept me safe for 122 long years.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3800.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32922","byteOffset":20339936,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_70552CF6","articyId":"72057821671263975","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And Thaddeus was in on it?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And Thaddeus was in on it?","TextSheVersion":"And Thaddeus was in on it?","TextTheyVersion":"And Thaddeus was in on it?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25691","byteOffset":17603560,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_7F125112","articyId":"72057821671263982","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Not really. Ava was his Automata. Which was lucky. I needed a capable mind to understand the challenge.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not really. Ava was his Automata. Which was lucky. I needed a capable mind to understand the challenge.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4400.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51214","byteOffset":33788640,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_5A204B24","articyId":"72057821671263989","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"But as long as Ava was alive, and under our auspices, her existence was evidence of LifeCorp's crime. The final coma roamer, an old friend for Thaddeus, and an insurance policy for me - Ava is many things to many people.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But as long as Ava was alive, and under our auspices, her existence was evidence of LifeCorp's crime. The final coma roamer, an old friend for Thaddeus, and an insurance policy for me - Ava is many things to many people.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5900.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36473","byteOffset":28143888,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_925B7C8A","articyId":"72057821671263996","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And now she's my friend.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And now she's my friend.","TextSheVersion":"And now she's my friend.","TextTheyVersion":"And now she's my friend."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6200.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47989","byteOffset":32492440,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_32EBBE42","articyId":"72057821671264010","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"We were in the perfect double-bind. He protected me, and I didn't kill him. Or Ava.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We were in the perfect double-bind. He protected me, and I didn't kill him. Or Ava.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6800.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18937","byteOffset":15051392,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_F97FC7F8","articyId":"72057821671264017","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you know where Ava's body is located?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you know where Ava's body is located?","TextSheVersion":"Do you know where Ava's body is located?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you know where Ava's body is located?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7100.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33990","byteOffset":20741072,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_E625F3CD","articyId":"72057821671264024","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Part of our deal was that I didn't know where Thaddeus took her. I just made sure it was possible for his people to remove her frozen body before the fire.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Part of our deal was that I didn't know where Thaddeus took her. I just made sure it was possible for his people to remove her frozen body before the fire.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7400.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30561","byteOffset":19441728,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_77CA1C77","articyId":"72057821671264031","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"If I find the body, what happens to you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If I find the body, what happens to you?","TextSheVersion":"If I find the body, what happens to you?","TextTheyVersion":"If I find the body, what happens to you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7700.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44600","byteOffset":31203808,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_8E06C99A","articyId":"72057821671264038","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Thaddeus is gone, so one corner of our little triangle of accountability is already lost. I don't know if you will find her, and if you do, I'm not sure I much care what happens to any of us afterwards dear.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thaddeus is gone, so one corner of our little triangle of accountability is already lost. I don't know if you will find her, and if you do, I'm not sure I much care what happens to any of us afterwards dear.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":8000.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33968","byteOffset":20732744,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_F727E10E","articyId":"72057821671264045","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"I'm very old. As they say in this great city, this is the party at the end of the world. The final fire is burning out, and all we can do now is dance in the light of the final flames. Goodbye.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm very old. As they say in this great city, this is the party at the end of the world. The final fire is burning out, and all we can do now is dance in the light of the final flames. Goodbye.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":8300.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46571","byteOffset":31950840,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_769BF9A9","articyId":"72057821671268165","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"How so?","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How so?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1700.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38745","byteOffset":28991000,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_7FE27475","articyId":"72057821671268172","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Letting me know you had books printed on paper was a giveaway.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Letting me know you had books printed on paper was a giveaway.","TextSheVersion":"Letting me know you had books printed on paper was a giveaway.","TextTheyVersion":"Letting me know you had books printed on paper was a giveaway."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2000.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45543","byteOffset":31561632,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_80070313","articyId":"72057821671268179","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"I have little to hide. Why would I need to? I've been around a long time dear.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have little to hide. Why would I need to? I've been around a long time dear.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38167","byteOffset":28773528,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_32837258","articyId":"72057821671268186","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Did Thaddeus have anything to do with burning the Coma Roamers to death?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did Thaddeus have anything to do with burning the Coma Roamers to death?","TextSheVersion":"Did Thaddeus have anything to do with burning the Coma Roamers to death?","TextTheyVersion":"Did Thaddeus have anything to do with burning the Coma Roamers to death?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2900.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50988","byteOffset":33629680,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_5312735D","articyId":"72057821671268195","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Thaddeus had a personal connection with his Automata and wanted to retain her, and I knew he had the resources to keep her safe and secret.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thaddeus had a personal connection with his Automata and wanted to retain her, and I knew he had the resources to keep her safe and secret.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4700.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30905","byteOffset":19574832,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_91FB81AF","articyId":"72057821671268202","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"And Thaddeus was one of the few people with either the skills or resources - I suspect the latter - to manipulate an Automata's memories. He seems to have even found a way to update Ava too, improving her performance and expanding her abilities.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And Thaddeus was one of the few people with either the skills or resources - I suspect the latter - to manipulate an Automata's memories. He seems to have even found a way to update Ava too, improving her performance and expanding her abilities.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5000.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49358","byteOffset":33015856,"byteLength":564}},{"id":"DFr_D76C44CE","articyId":"72057821671268209","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Why erase her memories?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why erase her memories?","TextSheVersion":"Why erase her memories?","TextTheyVersion":"Why erase her memories?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5300.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22337","byteOffset":16335920,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_36D5C55B","articyId":"72057821671268216","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"He made changes to her memories to protect her. He didn't erase the memories, he held and protected them. If Ava knew she was the last of her kind, she could put all three of us at risk.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He made changes to her memories to protect her. He didn't erase the memories, he held and protected them. If Ava knew she was the last of her kind, she could put all three of us at risk.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5600.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35895","byteOffset":27926800,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_3D468C2C","articyId":"72057821671268786","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"I admit, I've enjoyed leaving you little breadcrumb hints along the way.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I admit, I've enjoyed leaving you little breadcrumb hints along the way.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2600.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36486","byteOffset":28149336,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_2BDD47A8","articyId":"72057821671274328","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"She deserves to know, and be free.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She deserves to know, and be free.","TextSheVersion":"She deserves to know, and be free.","TextTheyVersion":"She deserves to know, and be free."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6200.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31983","byteOffset":19981760,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_2053DA63","articyId":"72057821671274335","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"It was a shaky equilibrium, but it held. I had the information to destroy LifeCorp and Thaddeus. He held my fate in his hands as well. Bound by secrecy. I'm sure we all had safeguards too. For example, if anything ever happened to me, I have friends who would leak Thaddeus' info to LifeCorp.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It was a shaky equilibrium, but it held. I had the information to destroy LifeCorp and Thaddeus. He held my fate in his hands as well. Bound by secrecy. I'm sure we all had safeguards too. For example, if anything ever happened to me, I have friends who would leak Thaddeus' info to LifeCorp.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6500.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19973","byteOffset":15440328,"byteLength":572}},{"id":"DFr_5A9EA4C5","articyId":"72057821671274343","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What are your plans now?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What are your plans now?","TextSheVersion":"What are your plans now?","TextTheyVersion":"What are your plans now?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7700.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36983","byteOffset":28334256,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_4AEC7587","articyId":"72057606922880999","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What does all this have to do with Thaddeus?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What does all this have to do with Thaddeus?","TextSheVersion":"What does all this have to do with Thaddeus?","TextTheyVersion":"What does all this have to do with Thaddeus?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43484","byteOffset":30779776,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_4E7EBF12","articyId":"72057606922881007","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"He was controlling her.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He was controlling her.","TextSheVersion":"He was controlling her.","TextTheyVersion":"He was controlling her."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5300.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20558","byteOffset":15661680,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_A062F3CC","articyId":"72057834556101912","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I know what you did.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I know what you did.","TextSheVersion":"I know what you did.","TextTheyVersion":"I know what you did."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":800.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31866","byteOffset":19936504,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_78AEE833","articyId":"72057834556101920","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"All the information was on the Deep Nets. You knew Ava could find it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"All the information was on the Deep Nets. You knew Ava could find it.","TextSheVersion":"All the information was on the Deep Nets. You knew Ava could find it.","TextTheyVersion":"All the information was on the Deep Nets. You knew Ava could find it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2000.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31117",